# Unicode CLDR, cldr-json cldr-dates-full/main/ha/dateFields.json.
# Every future relativeTime pattern is "cikin <unit> {0}" or "a cikin <unit>
# {0}" -- literally "inside", leading the unit it counts.
cikin
a cikin
# bayan is the ordinary "after", and "bayan kwanaki hudu" (ha.wikipedia.org)
# is the same forward offset cikin names, so it reads as one too.
bayan
